OL,3,AGlobal stocks plunge as fears over US
OL,4,AAI slowdown spread to Asia and Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestors are worried about tougher
OL,7,Fregulation of AI, after Democrat
OL,8,Fcandidates opposed the data centres
OL,9,Fneeded by the technology. The share
OL,10,Ffalls also come on top of concerns
OL,11,Fabout whether the huge amounts being
OL,12,Fspent on AI will pay off.
